<para>Fast skip: only scan isAliveData, update pointer once at the end. Uses relaxed atomic loads <ndash/> same codegen as plain loads on every mainstream target, but tells the compiler (and TSan) that concurrent writers are allowed. Acquire ordering is deferred to operator*()&apos;s yield point so the scan itself costs nothing extra. </para>
